  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.6.2: the HCVault.Native package layout is fixed - in all earlier versions the native libraries sat under a doubled runtimes/ prefix and were never copied to consuming builds (first volume operation failed with DllNotFoundException). Also: async filesystem operations (ReadFileAsync, WriteFileAsync, ListDirectoryAsync, ImportFileAsync, ExportFileAsync, ImportDirectoryAsync, ExportDirectoryAsync) and the native library is copied into RID-less (default debug) build outputs.",
